translate italian u19a2s6a_0f1045ec:

    # pc "I'm sorry Mi-Cha, I didn't mean to scare you. I'm just trying to help."
    pc "Mi dispiace, Mi-Cha, non volevo spaventarti. Sto solo cercando di aiutarti."

# game/Scenes/Update19/Act2/act2scene6a.rpy:74
translate italian u19a2s6a_f4665b14:

